<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: transport drone -->
  <TransportDrone.label>无人运输机</TransportDrone.label>
  <!-- EN: Drone for longer journeys and reaching orbit. Requires a shuttle engine, which can only be obtained from orbital traders and missions. Compared to a regular Shuttle, it has worse cargo capacity, faster recharge time before departure, and more efficient fuel consumption. -->
  <TransportDrone.description>用于长途飞行和进入轨道的无人机。需要配备一种穿梭引擎，这种引擎只能从轨道贸易商和任务中获取。与常规的穿梭机相比，它的载货能力较差，出发前的准备时间更短，燃料消耗效率更高。</TransportDrone.description>
  <!-- EN: {0} is ready to launch again. -->
  <TransportDrone.comps.CompLaunchable.cooldownEndedMessage>{0} 已准备好再次启动，并且燃油消耗更加高效</TransportDrone.comps.CompLaunchable.cooldownEndedMessage>
  <!-- EN: Chemfuel -->
  <TransportDrone.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>化合燃料</TransportDrone.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
